@startuml Admin Access Denied
title Access Denied for Non-Admin User

actor NonAdmin as "Non-Admin User"
participant "Admin App" as AdminApp
participant "Google OAuth" as Google
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

NonAdmin -> AdminApp: Open admin app
NonAdmin -> AdminApp: Click "Sign in with Google"
AdminApp -> Google: Request authentication
Google -> NonAdmin: Show login screen
NonAdmin -> Google: Enter credentials
Google -> AdminApp: Return valid ID token

AdminApp -> API: POST /api/auth/login/google\n{id_token}
API -> Google: Verify ID token
Google -> API: Token valid, return user info
API -> DB: Find user by Google sub
DB -> API: User found
API -> API: Check if user is admin
API -> API: User is NOT admin
API -> AdminApp: Return access denied error
AdminApp -> NonAdmin: Display "Access Denied" dialog
AdminApp -> NonAdmin: Remain on login screen

@enduml
